{"content":[{"c":["JERAHMEEL"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["1. Firstborn of Hezron’s three sons, the father of six sons and a descendant of Judah through Perez’s line (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.2.9-42","r":"1Chr.2.9-42","rawR":"1Chr.2.9-42","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.2.9-42","value":"1Chr.2.9-42"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 2:9-42"},"). He was the founder of the family of Jerahmeelites, who in David’s time lived in the Negev region and occupied a number of cities (",{"href":"?bref=1Sam.27.10","r":"1Sam.27.10","rawR":"1Sam.27.10","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Sam.27.10","value":"1Sam.27.10"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Sm 27:10"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=1Sam.30.29","r":"1Sam.30.29","rawR":"1Sam.30.29","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Sam.30.29","value":"1Sam.30.29"}],"t":"ref","v":"30:29"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["2. Kish’s son and a Levite family leader who served in the sanctuary during David’s reign (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.24.29","r":"1Chr.24.29","rawR":"1Chr.24.29","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.24.29","value":"1Chr.24.29"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 24:29"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["3. Son of King Jehoiakim of Judah and one who, with Shelemiah and Seraiah, was ordered by the king to seize Baruch and Jeremiah (",{"href":"?bref=Jer.36.26","r":"Jer.36.26","rawR":"Jer.36.26","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Jer.36.26","value":"Jer.36.26"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jer 36:26"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Jerahmeel","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"1 Chr 2:9-42","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.2.9-42","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.2.9-42","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.2.9-42"},{"anchorText":"1 Sm 27:10","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Sam.27.10","rawQueryValue":"1Sam.27.10","sourceRefExact":"1Sam.27.10"},{"anchorText":"30:29","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Sam.30.29","rawQueryValue":"1Sam.30.29","sourceRefExact":"1Sam.30.29"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 24:29","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.24.29","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.24.29","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.24.29"},{"anchorText":"Jer 36:26","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Jer.36.26","rawQueryValue":"Jer.36.26","sourceRefExact":"Jer.36.26"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"d467f1580f954842c8747ae7d702d1047567766e4aaa2174e5e3e1e17f5a558c","sourceItemName":"Jerahmeel","sourceItemOrder":180,"sourceMember":"Articles/J.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Jerahmeel","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Jerahmeel","title":"Jerahmeel","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}